  0.4018  2026-04-27 12:29:41 PDT
          - Fix HTTP request smuggling: Transfer-Encoding now takes precedence
            over Content-Length per RFC 7230 §3.3.3 (CVE-2026-40560, bsc#1263364)</comment>
